WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.534
-But, you know what?
Today is Friday.

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:03.634
You know, let's kick off
the weekend with something fun.

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:04.701
You know?

00:00:04.701 --> 00:00:05.934
Let's -- let's
catch up on some e-mails.

00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:07.033
-Right.
-It's our first week back.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:08.434
-Yeah.
-You know, I want to thank

00:00:08.434 --> 00:00:09.701
everybody
for what a great week

00:00:09.701 --> 00:00:10.834
of shows we had here.

00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:12.601
I want to...
-It's wonderful to be back.

00:00:12.601 --> 00:00:13.934
-Maybe I'll send out
some thank you notes.

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:15.000
-Really?
-If you guys...?

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.868 --> 00:00:17.901
Can I do them right now?

00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:19.267
Do you mind
if I do it right now?

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:20.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.334 --> 00:00:22.734
Thank you so much.
-Wow.

00:00:22.734 --> 00:00:24.734
-James, can I get some

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:26.634
thank-you-note-writing music,
please?

00:00:26.634 --> 00:00:27.634
[ Gentle piano music playing ]

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:28.734
-Wow.
-Wow.

00:00:28.734 --> 00:00:29.901
-He's happy to be back.

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:32.033
-Hey, a little rusty.
He's a little rusty.

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:34.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:35.334
-Eh!

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.334
[ Gentle piano music plays ]

00:00:38.334 --> 00:00:41.200
-Thank you,
Bed, Bath and Beyond

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.767
for dressing up
as Spirit Halloween this year.

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:46.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:49.968
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:49.968 --> 00:00:51.834
-Well, it's beyond.

00:00:51.834 --> 00:00:53.067
[ Gentle piano music plays]

00:00:53.067 --> 00:00:55.901
-Thank you,
Las Vegas sphere

00:00:55.901 --> 00:00:58.601
for looking like Epcot
going through an emo phase.

00:00:58.601 --> 00:01:00.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:00.334 --> 00:01:03.033
[ As angry emo ]
Talk to me.

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:08.801
You're not my real dad.

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:09.868
[ Gentle piano music plays ]

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:12.501
Normal voice ] Thank you,
TSA body scanners

00:01:12.501 --> 00:01:13.801
for making me feel like

00:01:13.801 --> 00:01:17.567
I can't get on the plane
unless I do the "M" in "YMCA."

00:01:17.567 --> 00:01:20.567
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:25.000
-And pat down.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.100
[ Gentle piano music plays ]

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:28.267
-Thank you,
fish sticks

00:01:28.267 --> 00:01:30.767
for being perfect for anyone
who ate a mozzarella stick

00:01:30.767 --> 00:01:33.667
and thought if only
this tasted like carp.

00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:36.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:37.834 --> 00:01:41.968
♪ I can dream, can't I dream? ♪

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.033
[ Gentle piano music plays ]

00:01:45.033 --> 00:01:47.534
Thank you,
Clear umbrellas

00:01:47.534 --> 00:01:50.267
for pranking the rain into
thinking it's going to get me.

00:01:50.267 --> 00:01:51.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.934 --> 00:01:53.968
[ Cymbal clangs ]

00:01:53.968 --> 00:01:55.701
I love you.
You're the best.

00:01:55.701 --> 00:01:57.033
I love you guys.

00:01:57.033 --> 00:01:58.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:58.467 --> 00:02:00.267
-Whoo!
[ Indistinct ]

00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:02.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.334 --> 00:02:05.334
-Hahaha!
-All right.

00:02:05.334 --> 00:02:06.968
[ Slow piano music plays ]

00:02:06.968 --> 00:02:08.000
Thank you,

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:10.434
Hershey's Halloween
variety packs

00:02:10.434 --> 00:02:12.801
for single handedly
keeping Mr. Goodbar alive.

00:02:12.801 --> 00:02:13.801
[ Audience groans ]

00:02:13.801 --> 00:02:14.801
[ Applause ]

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:16.334
Wah, wah, wah?

00:02:16.334 --> 00:02:18.467
-I'm looking for Mr. Goodbar.

00:02:18.467 --> 00:02:20.067
-I don't see much him.
-I'm looking for him.

00:02:21.734 --> 00:02:22.801
[ Gentle piano music plays ]

00:02:22.801 --> 00:02:24.934
Thank you,
trying to help my children

00:02:24.934 --> 00:02:28.033
with their homework for being
a tough but fair reminder

00:02:28.033 --> 00:02:29.767
of why I got into comedy.

00:02:29.767 --> 00:02:31.467
There you have it, everybody.
Those are my "Thank You Notes."

